  "title": "Ellington Financial Declares Monthly Common Dividend",
  "summary": "OLD GREENWICH, Conn. --(BUSINESS WIRE)--May 7, 2026-- Ellington Financial Inc. (NYSE: EFC) (\"we\") today announced that its Board of Directors has declared a monthly dividend of $0.13 per share of common stock, payable on June 30, 2026 to common stockholders of record as of May 29, 2026.",
